Removal of Condition 8 (Secured by Design) attached to planning permission P/4658/20 dated 14/12/2021 for&nbsp;Conversion of office (Use class E) to five flats (2 X 1 bed, 3 X 2 bed); reinstatement of courtyard; replacement windows to front elevation; 
replacement of door with new window to front elevation; new door to rear elevation; front boundary railings, timber canopy and external 
alterations; bin and cycle stores (Amended Description and Drawings)
